        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hana wakatendelela, wakamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elekana wakahingana ku Lama ku nsubu wandi. Muana wakakuatshila Yehowa mudimu ku mesu kua Eli muakuidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana balume ba Eli bakadi bantu babi, kabakamanya Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuidi ba bantu bakadi ne tshilele tshiabo bu nunku ne, hakalua muntu yonso ne nyama wa kushiha bu mulambu, ne hakadi munyinyi eu usaba ha kahia, muhika wa muakuidi wakalua ne nkalafa udi ne menu asatu mu tshianza tshiandi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakatua mu luesu anyi mu dilonga anyi mu luesu lunene; ne muakuidi wakadiangatshila munyinyi wonso wakakuata ku nkalafa. Bakenzela Bena Isalele bonso nunku bakalua ku Shilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, diambedi kabayi banze kuosha dianyi, muhika wa muakuidi wakalua, wamhila muena mulambu ne, Umpe munyinyi wa kuanyikila muakuidi, bualu bua yeye kena musue munyinyi uwakalamba mu luesu, udi musue munyinyi mubishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bikaleye mumuambile ne, Nebadianjile kuosha dianyi, hashishe udi mumanye mua kuangata bungi hudi mutshima webe musue, muhika wakamuambila ne, Nansha, biwahidia kumpa katataka, meme nengunyenge ku bukole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualuebu bua bansongalume buakatamba bubi ku mesu kua Yehowa, bualu bua bobo bakalengulula mulambu wa Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakenzela Yehowa mudimu; hakatshidiye muana, wakadi uluata efoda wa lin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mamu wandi wakamulelela diyeka dikese, wakadi ulua nʼadi ku tshidimu ku tshidimu bakalueye ne bayandi bua kufileye milambu ya ku tshidimu ku tshidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eli wakavudishila Elekana ne mukashi wandi disanka, wakamba ne, Yehowa akuhe bana bakuabo ne mukashi eu bualu bua kulomba kuakalombeye Yehowa. Bakahingana ku nsubu wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakavuluka Hana; yeye wakimita kabidi, wakalela bana ba balume basatu ne bana ba bakashi babidi. Muana eu Samuele wakadiunda ku mesu kua Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eli wakalua muntu mununu; wakunyua lumu lua malu mabi a bana bandi ba balume akenzelabo Bena Isalele bonso, ne bu muakalalabo ne bakashi bakadi benza mudimu ku mbelu kua ntenta wa kusambakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabakonka ne, Bualu kai nudi nuenza malu â? Nakunvua lumu lua malu mabi anudi nuenzela bantu aba bonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nansha, bana banyi balume, tshiakunvua lumu luenu luimpe: nudi nuenzesha bantu ba Yehowa malu mabi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzela muntu munga muntu bibi, Nzambi neamulumbuluishe, kadi bienzela muntu Yehowa bibi, nganyi wamuakuila? Kadi bobo kabakunvua dî dia tatu wabo bualu bua Yehowa wakamana kuhangidisha bua kubashiha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana eu Samuele wakadiunda, wakaleha mu diakalengele kudi Yehowa ne kudi bantu kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wa Nzambi wakalua kudi Eli, wakamba ne, Yehowa udi ukukonka ne, Tshiakadimuenesha kudi ba mu nsubu wa tatu webe hakadibo mu Ejipitu mu nsubu wa Palo, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshiakamusungula munkatshi mua bisamba bionso bia Bena Isalele bua kuikaleye muakuidi wanyi ne bua kufueye milambu ku tshioshelu tshianyi ne bua kuosheye musenga wa manananshi ne bua kulaleye efoda ku mpala kuanyi, anyi? Meme tshiakaha ba mu nsubu wa tatu webe milambu yonso yakosha Bena Isalele ha kahia, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nudi nudiata milambu yanyi ya kuosha ne bintu bidibo bafila kundi binakanuelela mikenji yanyi bua bualu buabi, ne udi utumbishe bana bebe ba balume ku mutu kuanyi bua kudidiundishabo ne bintu bidi bitamba bulengele bia milambu yonso ya bantu banyi Bena Isalele bualu kai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Nakadianjila kuamba ne, Ba mu nsubu webe ne ba mu nsubu wa tatu webe nebende ku mesu kuanyi tshiendelele; kadi katataka Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bualu ebu bumuke kundi, bualu bua badi bantumbisha nembatumbishe, ne badi bampetula, nembalengulule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangila, matuku akadi ha kulua andi nkukosa diboko diebe ne maboko a badi mu nsubu wa tatu webe, nansha muntu mununu washala mu nsubu webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe neumone dikenga dia badi mu nsubu wanyi havuisha Nzambi Bena Isalele bubanji; nansha muntu mununu washala mu nsubu webe tô ne tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu undi tshiyi ngumusha ku tshioshelu tshianyi, neikale bua kukusunsuma mu mesu ebe ne bua kunyingalasha mutshima webe; ne bana bonso hadibo balela mu nsubu webe nebafue hatshidibo ne bukole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu ebu budi bulua kudi bana bebe babidi, Hofeni ne Pinehasa, nebuikale bu tshimanyinu kudi; bubidi buabo nebafue dituku dimue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenditekele muakuidi wa kanemu; yeye neangenzele malu anakasungula mu mutshima wanyi ne mu lungenyi luanyi. Meme nenjadike nsubu wandi: yeye nende ku mesu kua wanyi unakuela manyi ha mutu tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
